    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about a \"setback\" though. it's the same pattern every single time. i feel like i'm just a broken person and no matter what i do eventually i'll just fail again. it's like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. why do we even bother fighting against something that's just gonna happen anyway?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
