      "role": "user",
      "content": "perspective shifts dont change the fact that the cycle is exhausting. it’s just constant struggle, then guilt, then struggle again. it feels more like a trap than a habit. sometimes i look at it and think it would just be easier if the cycle just stopped. like, if i could just opt out of the whole thing instead of being stuck in this loop forever.",
