      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is completely valid, and the weight of that constant struggle can feel unbearable. If the cycle is truly a trap, then the most immediate and honest thing you can do is let yourself be in a place where the struggle stops. Reaching out to a professional can provide the tools to break those deeply ingrained patterns safely. Please know that there are people who want to support you through this incredibly difficult time.",
